<title>HUNGARY: CESI index dips to end at 1,450.00 pts.</title>
<headline>CESI index dips to end at 1,450.00 pts.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CESI Central European Share Index eased 6.62 points or 0.45 percent to 1,450.00 points on Monday, the Budapest Stock Exchange said. The index reflects trends of 72 Hungarian, Polish, Czech, Slovak and Slovenian shares.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
